def public interest entity is identified by "http://example.org/accounting-graph#Def_PublicInterestEntity".

def public interest entity is a definition.

def public interest entity has the label "Definition: Public-Interest Entities".

def public interest entity is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/art_2/par_1/oj".

def public interest entity has the definiens "undertakings within the scope of Article 1 which are: (a) governed by the law of a Member State and whose transferable securities are admitted to trading on a regulated market of any Member State within the meaning of point (14) of Article 4(1) of Directive 2004/39/EC...; (b) credit institutions as defined in point (1) of Article 4 of Directive 2006/48/EC..., other than those referred to in Article 2 of that Directive; (c) insurance undertakings within the meaning of Article 2(1) of Council Directive 91/674/EEC...; or (d) designated by Member States as public-interest entities, for instance undertakings that are of significant public relevance because of the nature of their business, their size or the number of their employees;".

def public interest entity has the definiendum "public-interest entities".


def micro undertaking is identified by "http://example.org/accounting-graph#Def_MicroUndertaking".

def micro undertaking is a definition.

def micro undertaking has the label "Definition: Micro-undertakings".

def micro undertaking is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/art_3/par_1/oj".

def micro undertaking has the definiens "undertakings which on their balance sheet dates do not exceed the limits of at least two of the three following criteria:".

def micro undertaking has the definiendum "micro-undertakings".

def micro undertaking defines actor micro undertaking.


