norm management report content is identified by "http://example.org/accounting-graph#Norm_ManagementReportContent".

norm management report content is a constitutive rule.

norm management report content has the label "Obligation for Content of Management Report".

norm management report content is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/art_19/par_1/oj".

norm management report content has the legal text "The management report shall include a fair review of the development and performance of the undertaking's business and of its position, together with a description of the principal risks and uncertainties that it faces.".


norm publication obligation is identified by "http://example.org/accounting-graph#Norm_PublicationObligation".

norm publication obligation is a substantive rule.

norm publication obligation has the label "General Publication Obligation".

norm publication obligation has the modality obligation.

norm publication obligation has for "eli-lo:applies_to" the resource actor micro undertaking.

norm publication obligation has for "eli-lo:applies_to" the resource actor small undertaking.

norm publication obligation has for "eli-lo:applies_to" the resource actor medium sized undertaking.

norm publication obligation has for "eli-lo:applies_to" the resource actor large undertaking.

norm publication obligation produces step publish full report.

norm publication obligation is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/dir/2013/34/art_30/par_1/oj".

norm publication obligation has the legal text "Member States shall ensure that undertakings publish within a reasonable period of time, which shall not exceed 12 months after the balance sheet date, the duly approved annual financial statements and the management report, together with the opinion submitted by the statutory auditor or audit firm...".


