% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
scenario calendar is, as stated in the source description:
    % A case for the calendar: the events that a deadline counts from, and the rhythms that
    % count from nothing else, start on 2027-01-01.
    the calendar starts on 2027-01-01.
    "balance sheet date" happens on 2027-01-01.
    due_dates expects answers ["actor large undertaking has step publish full report due on 2028-01-01", "actor medium sized undertaking has step publish full report due on 2028-01-01", "actor micro undertaking has step publish full report due on 2028-01-01", "actor small undertaking has step publish full report due on 2028-01-01"].
    due_in_2027 expects answers [].

scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    modalities expects answers ["norm publication obligation has the modality obligation", "norm transposition obligation has the modality obligation"].
    actions_of_rules expects answers ["norm publication obligation produces step publish full report", "norm transposition obligation produces step bring in force", "norm transposition obligation produces step communicate text"].
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["actor large undertaking acts as addresser in step publish full report", "actor medium sized undertaking acts as addresser in step publish full report", "actor micro undertaking acts as addresser in step publish full report", "actor small undertaking acts as addresser in step publish full report", "agent commission acts as addressee in step communicate text", "agent member state acts as addressee in step bring in force", "agent member state acts as addresser in step communicate text"].

scenario reporting_2027 is, as stated in the source description:
    bigco is of the type actor large undertaking.
    smallco is of the type actor small undertaking.
    "balance sheet date" happens to bigco on 2025-12-31.
    "balance sheet date" happens to smallco on 2025-12-31.
    bigco performs step publish full report on 2026-11-30.
    must_perform expects answers ["bigco must perform step publish full report by 2026-12-31 under norm publication obligation", "smallco must perform step publish full report by 2026-12-31 under norm publication obligation"].
    late_on_1_february_2027 expects answers ["smallco is late with step publish full report under norm publication obligation on 2027-02-01"].

query obligations is:
